{"id":"4bba60e501636617e246d2b3684fd476","name":"Co-witnesses sharing one canonical memory each propagate hearsay independently on departure","start":1792923096903,"stop":1792923096904,"duration":1,"status":"passed","fullName":"tests.test_memory_preservation#test_cowitnesses_propagate_independently_on_their_own_departure","historyId":"a15cb69c8603e76be762c787879f350e.d41d8cd98f00b204e9800998ecf8427e","flaky":false,"muted":false,"known":false,"isRetry":false,"labels":[{"name":"story","value":"preserve_departing_npc_memories"},{"name":"epic","value":"Knowledge Graph"},{"name":"feature","value":"Departure memory preservation"},{"name":"parentSuite","value":"tests"},{"name":"suite","value":"test_memory_preservation"},{"name":"host","value":"runnervmtai0g"},{"name":"thread","value":"2142-MainThread"},{"name":"framework","value":"pytest"},{"name":"language","value":"cpython3"},{"name":"package","value":"tests.test_memory_preservation"}],"groupedLabels":{"story":["preserve_departing_npc_memories"],"epic":["Knowledge Graph"],"feature":["Departure memory preservation"],"parentSuite":["tests"],"suite":["test_memory_preservation"],"host":["runnervmtai0g"],"thread":["2142-MainThread"],"framework":["pytest"],"language":["cpython3"],"package":["tests.test_memory_preservation"]},"parameters":[],"links":[],"steps":[],"error":{},"testCase":{"id":"a15cb69c8603e76be762c787879f350e","externalId":"4c78ed4caf46ffa2b48647f63f4f2e57","name":"Co-witnesses sharing one canonical memory each propagate hearsay independently on departure","fullName":"tests.test_memory_preservation#test_cowitnesses_propagate_independently_on_their_own_departure"},"descriptionHtml":"<p>Per-edge idempotency: a shared canonical node must not let the\nfirst departing co-witness mute everyone else's propagation.</p>\n<pre><code>Two co-witnesses share one LOCAL ``PERSONAL_EXPERIENCE`` node —\nthe shape produced by the sub-linear co-witness broadcast in\nLOCAL-scope memory creation. After the first witness leaves the\nscene, the second witness's later departure must still fan a\nfresh hearsay copy out, attributed to *that* witness as\n``told_by``. Locking this catches a regression where the\npropagation tag was stored on the node and the second departure\nbecame a silent no-op.\n</code></pre>\n","environment":"default","setup":[{"id":"3322cf690afddeb9641797b7941dcc46","type":"before","name":"event_loop_policy","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0},{"id":"cd0948a54a1435e44e96bb8170518ddd","type":"before","name":"_install_log_scrubber","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0}],"teardown":[{"id":"032c92a368fc529f5d8b41ea2aff5b98","type":"after","name":"_install_log_scrubber::0","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0}],"history":[],"retries":[],"breadcrumbs":[["tests","test_memory_preservation"]],"retry":false,"titlePath":["tests","test_memory_preservation.py"],"retriesCount":0,"attachments":[],"order":1587,"categories":[]}